BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5bdca79253055f4ed9b6df7e@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260829T180420Z
SUMMARY:SAMSARA (2011)
LOCATION:DeBartolo Performing Arts Center\, 100 Performing Arts Center | No
 tre Dame\, 46556
DESCRIPTION:GET TICKETSBrowning Cinema Sunday Docs Directed by Ron Fricke W
 ith Puti Sri Candra Dewi\, Marcos Luna\, Kikumaru Rated PG-13\, 102 minut
 es\, DCP With Samsara\, filmmaker Ron Fricke continues the legacy of the 
 Qatsi trilogy by creating a global travelogue with pictures and music\, e
 xploring the Himalayas\, the American Southwest\, European cathedrals\, a
 nd other beautiful sites. The focus here is the Poetic Documentary\, whic
 h is a classification of films that rely less on linear continuity used t
 o create narratives or storylines in films depicting reality. Often lushl
 y shot\, the editing of this slice of documentaries pushes for emotional 
 experiences as opposed to the more educational approaches taken by other 
 styles. Sponsored by the Meg and John P. Brogan Endowment for Documentary
  Film.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/samsara-2011/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/samsara-2011/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260830T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260830T173000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
